#@baseUrl = http://localhost:5116
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Lista
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books

### Dodanie
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn13": "9788375780635",
  "title": "Ostatnie życzenie",
  "authors": "Andrzej Sapkowski",
  "publisher": "superNOWA",
  "publishedYear": 2014,
  "language": "pl",
  "status": "Read",
  "location": "Salon",
  "rating": 5
}

### Pobranie dodanej
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{create.response.body.id}}

### Edycja (wypożyczenie)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{create.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn13": "9788375780635",
  "title": "Ostatnie życzenie",
  "authors": "Andrzej Sapkowski",
  "status": "Read",
  "location": "Salon",
  "borrower": "Kasia",
  "borrowedAt": "2026-11-21T18:00:00Z",
  "rating": 5
}

### Duplikat ISBN → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isbn13": "9788375780635", "title": "Duplikat", "authors": "Ktoś", "status": "ToRead" }

### Błędy walidacji → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isbn13": "123", "title": "", "authors": "X", "rating": 7, "status": "ToRead" }

### Usunięcie → 204, ponowne → 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{create.response.body.id}}


### Nieistniejąca → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/99999
